- If the user requests **UTAG-based tissue or niche annotation** on a spatial AnnData object → call `niche_annotation_tool` with spatial_anndata_path. If the cell-type labels live in a non-default column, pass celltype_key. If the user specifies a particular UTAG resolution/column or label set, pass niche_key and allowed_labels.

